## 📤 Share Your Swarm Instantly

- **QR Code**: Every participant scans the QR code shown in the IPNS panel; it encodes the current URL. Because the Yjs room name is static (`quantm-foam-v23`), anyone who opens the link immediately joins the same shared state.
- **P2P Magnet Links**: Pre‑seed historical data with a magnet link; the Torrent panel lets you drop it in, and the data automatically populates DuckDB for all connected peers.

